course: dictionary
lesson: 13420
title: Hitter: one word, many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A word can have more than one meaning. The word hitter means a person who hits, but the meaning changes with the setting. Read the words around it to find the right one, and try each meaning in the sentence to see which one fits.
explain: «Maya is the best hitter on our baseball team. She hit the ball over the fence.» Here a hitter is a batter, the player whose job is to hit the ball. The baseball words tell you which meaning to use.
explain: «The new boss is a heavy hitter in the money world.» A heavy hitter is not a person who is heavy or who hits things. The word money and the idea of a big job tell you that it means a powerful or important person.
fact: A hitter is a person who hits, especially a batter in baseball or softball.
fact: «Hitter» can also mean someone who hits the ball hard in cricket.
fact: «Heavy hitter» is an informal phrase that means a powerful or important person or organisation.
fact: A hitter's batting average is hits divided by times at bat.
fact: When a word has several meanings, the context tells you which one the writer means.
exercise: «Maya is the best hitter on our baseball team.» In baseball, what is a hitter? | An umpire who calls the game | *A batter whose job is to hit the ball | A person who counts the runs | A player who runs the bases
exercise: The news says, «Three heavy hitters came to the meeting.» What does heavy hitters mean? | People who are always late | Very heavy boxes | *Powerful or important people | People who hit things hard
exercise: «Sam is a big hitter who scores lots of sixes in cricket.» Find and copy one word that means a player who hits the ball. | sixes | Sam | scores | *hitter
test: A hitter has 3 hits from 12 times at bat. Batting average = hits ÷ times at bat. What is the batting average? | 9 | 4 | 0.4 | *0.25
test: In cricket, what does a hitter do? | *Hits the ball hard | Keeps the wickets | Counts the runs at the end | Bowls the ball fast
exam: Jayden says a heavy hitter must be a very heavy box. What is the right meaning? | A person who hits people in a fight | A very heavy object | *A powerful or important person | A person who is always late
